---
import config from '../../site-config.json';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import FinalCTA from '../components/FinalCTA.astro';

const { meta, colors, typography, header, footer, finalCta } = config;

const pageTitle = 'Privacy Policy | ILM Assignment Help';
const pageDescription = 'How ILM Assignment Help collects, uses, and protects your personal data, including your rights under UK GDPR.';
---

<Layout
  title={pageTitle}
  description={pageDescription}
  faviconPath={meta.faviconPath}
  googleFontsUrl={meta.googleFontsUrl}
  fontFamily={typography.fontFamily}
  colors={colors}
>
  <Header logoText={header.logoText} logoHref="/" navLinks={header.navLinks} />

  <PageHero
    badge="Legal"
    crumbLabel="Privacy Policy"
    h1="Privacy Policy"
    intro="How we collect, use, and protect your personal data when you use ILM Assignment Help."
  />

  <main class="page-content">
    <div class="container">
      <article class="prose">
        <span class="last-updated">Last updated: July 2026</span>

        <h2>1. Who We Are</h2>
        <p>
          ILM Assignment Help ("we", "us", "our") provides academic writing and assignment support to candidates
          studying City & Guilds ILM leadership and management qualifications, operating at
          ilmassignment.help. This policy explains how we handle personal data collected through this website and
          through the order process.
        </p>

        <h2>2. What Data We Collect and Why</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Enquiry and order information:</strong> your name, email address, WhatsApp number, ILM level and unit details, deadlines, and any files or assignment briefs you send us, used to confirm your order and complete your assignment.</li>
          <li><strong>Payment information:</strong> processed directly by our third-party payment providers. We do not store your full card details on our own systems.</li>
          <li><strong>Live chat data:</strong> if you use the live chat widget on this site, your messages are handled by Tawk.to, our live chat provider, under its own privacy policy.</li>
          <li><strong>Basic technical data:</strong> standard server and browser information (such as browser type and page requested) generated automatically by visiting the site.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Legal Basis for Processing (UK GDPR)</h2>
        <p>
          We process your data on the following legal bases: performance of a contract, to deliver the service you
          have ordered; legitimate interests, to operate and improve this website and respond to enquiries; and
          consent, where you have opted in to a specific non-essential use, such as certain cookies.
        </p>

        <h2>4. How We Share Your Data</h2>
        <p>
          Your personal information is shared only with the writer and reviewer assigned to your order, and is never
          sold or shared with third parties for marketing purposes. Where we use third-party service providers, such
          as our payment processor and Tawk.to for live chat, those providers process data under their own privacy
          policies and only to the extent needed to provide their service to us.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>Under UK GDPR, you have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Access the personal data we hold about you</li>
          <li>Correct inaccurate data</li>
          <li>Request erasure of your data, subject to any legal or contractual retention requirements</li>
          <li>Restrict or object to certain processing</li>
          <li>Request a portable copy of your data</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          To exercise any of these rights, contact us at <a href={`mailto:${footer.contactEmail}`}>{footer.contactEmail}</a>.
          We aim to respond within 30 days. If you are not satisfied with our response, you have the right to lodge a
          complaint with the Information Commissioner's Office (ICO).
        </p>

        <h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>
          Order data and submitted files are retained for as long as needed to complete your order and handle any
          revision requests within the 14-day revision window, and are deleted or archived afterward unless you ask
          us to retain them for a future order.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this policy from time to time. The current version is always available at this page, and the
          "last updated" date at the top of this page reflects the most recent revision.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about this policy or how your data is handled can be sent to
          <a href={`mailto:${footer.contactEmail}`}>{footer.contactEmail}</a> or via
          <a href={`https://wa.me/${footer.whatsapp.replace(/\D/g, '')}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp</a>.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>

  <FinalCTA heading={finalCta.heading} subtext={finalCta.subtext} button={finalCta.button} />
  <Footer
    logoText={footer.logoText}
    description={footer.description}
    columns={footer.columns}
    copyright={footer.copyright}
    contactEmail={footer.contactEmail}
    whatsapp={footer.whatsapp}
  />
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-content .container { max-width: 820px; }
</style>
